{"id":"wb-5-411","name":"小昭寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"小昭寺","text":"小昭寺（藏语：ར་མོ་ཆེ་དགོན་པ་，威利转写：ra-mo che dgon-pa，藏语拼音：Ramoqê Gönba），位于西藏自治区拉萨市城关区吉崩岗街道热木齐路49号，是拉萨名胜之一，通常与大昭寺连称“拉萨二昭”而驰名于世。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E6%98%AD%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":95266518,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95266518","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/be5449fd0fe489cee1857426.jpg","title":"RamocheTemple.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:RamocheTemple.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/65/RamocheTemple.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Taken by Fanghong","license":"CC BY 2.5","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.5","caption":"Ramoche temple in Lhasa","width":320,"height":313}}